OL,3,GNEWSAThird stoat killed and hunt for a 
OL,4,Afourth on Orkney island                
OL,6,FIt is not known how the creatures      
OL,7,Farrived on the island, but             
OL,8,Fconservationists said the sighting on  
OL,9,F16 November was "deeply concerning".   
